Question 39.  
Determine the output of the code segment shown on the right 
and write your answer in the blank provided on the answer 
document. 
public static void main(String[] args) { 
  out.print(method(5));  

} 


public static int method(int i) { 
  if(i < 1) 
    return 10; 
  else if(i % 2 == 0) 
    return 2 * i + method(--i); 
  else 
    return 3 * i + method(--i); 
} 
